{"segs": ["PA_ja_126:0.4", "PA_ja_126:1.1"], "en": "6. The Aśvalakṣaṇa Jātaka “That alone is his good fortune,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
